{"parentUuid":"7f706434-db0a-460c-853e-712a3eafb404","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01TaXtCiPrZYX62Gkc94svdL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01R5AVpcVNToaa4tAAGyHqvT","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\runtime\\manifests\\templates\\vision_ingestion_pipeline.json","content":"{\n  \"schema_version\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": \"vision-ingestion-pipeline-v1\",\n  \"name\": \"Vision-Augmented Ingestion Pipeline\",\n  \"description\": \"Declarative end-to-end pipeline (ADR-003 / VIS-001): parse a document into Docling's element tree, classify each visual element, describe it with a local VLM through a type-routed escalation ladder (illustration→caption, diagram→Mermaid/PlantUML, chart→JSON+desc, table→JSON), validate every surrogate, stitch them back in reading order into enriched markdown, then hand off to the EXISTING rag_ingest + deep_synthesis (PageIndex) spine so figure-derived facts land in Neo4j with Section provenance. The vision stages PREPEND to the current pipeline — downstream ingest is unchanged.\",\n  \"requirement\": \"Stop discarding figures/diagrams/charts/tables at ingest: turn them into graph-ready, agent-readable surrogates anchored to their source Section, page and bbox.\",\n\n  \"__doc\": {\n    \"variables\": \"Values of the form ${name} are substituted at load time from (in order): CLI flags, environment variables, and then the `variables` map below (as defaults). Unresolved variables are left literal so a future runner can bind them.\",\n    \"execution.kind\": \"Dispatcher hint consumed by the CLI/executor: 'inspect_and_classify' | 'fire_and_poll' | 'blocking' | 'blocking_with_task_fallback' | 'blocking_with_task_list_fallback' | 'validate' | 'report'.\",\n    \"status\": \"DESIGN-TIME SPEC. Tasks docmodel_extract / classify_elements / describe_visuals / validate_surrogates / stitch_enriched reference skills + endpoin