_surrogates`, `stitch_enriched`) are the VIS-001 Phase 0–3 deliverables — flagged `[NEW — VIS-001 Phase N]` per task. `rag_ingest`/`deep_synthesis` are runnable today. So the manifest doubles as the executable spec: ship a wave at a time, and until a wave's skills land it's a dry/inspect target.\n- **The no-hollow-success gates are baked into the DAG.** `validate_surrogates` (Mermaid must parse, JSON must validate, else caption fallback) and `validate_vision` (fail if zero figure-derived Sections) are real `validate`-kind tasks with assertions — the pipeline refuses to claim success on garbage.\n- **The FLM risk is a one-line switch.** `vlm_model` defaults to `lemonade/qwen3vl-it-4b-FLM`; if the OQ-1 spike shows FLM rejects `image_url`, set `vlm_model=${vlm_fallback}` (lmstudio). No structural change.\n\nDispatch is `benny enrich --manifest manifests/templates/vision_ingestion_pipeline.json` (with `--resume <run_id>` to reuse cached waves). I also wired the manifest into the [project plan](runtime/docs/requirements/13/project_plan.md) so the docs stay in sync.\n\nWant me to kick off the **OQ-1 spike** next (the multimodal `call_model` + FLM-vs-lmstudio image round-trip), since that's the gate the whole `describe_visuals` wave hangs on?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":509,"cache_read_input_tokens":153065,"output_tokens":1173,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":509,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1173,"cache_read_input_tokens":153065,"cache_creation_input_tokens":509,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":509},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcVu4BAtbMcivGr3NCAcm","type":"assistant","uuid":"ef9a07e7-71ee-4da5-91bf-0