{"parentUuid":"c3c3a026-681f-4080-9820-949ef9985404","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\runtime\\benny\\core\\vision.py","snippet":"1\t\"\"\"\n2\tVision message helpers (VIS-001 / ADR-003).\n3\t\n4\tBuild OpenAI-style multimodal chat content for the `vision` role. OQ-1 confirmed\n5\tqwen3vl-it-4b-FLM on Lemonade accepts the `image_url` OBJECT form\n6\t(``{\"type\": \"image_url\", \"image_url\": {\"url\": <data-uri>}}``), so that is what we\n7\temit. Calls flow through ``call_model()`` like any other model (ADR-001 / VIS-SEC3).\n8\t\"\"\"\n9\t\n10\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n11\t\n12\timport base64\n13\tfrom pathlib import Path\n14\tfrom typing import Any, Dict, List, Union\n15\t\n16\tImageSource = Union[str, bytes, Path]  # data-uri/url string, raw bytes, or a file path\n17\t\n...\n27\t            mime = \"image/jpeg\"\n28\t        elif ext in (\"png\", \"gif\", \"webp\", \"bmp\"):\n29\t            mime = f\"image/{'jpeg' if ext == 'jpg' else ext}\"\n30\t    else:\n31\t        data = image\n32\t    return f\"data:{mime};base64,\" + base64.b64encode(data).decode()\n33\t\n34\t\n35\tdef vision_message(\n36\t    text: str, *images: ImageSource, mime: str = \"image/png\"\n37\t) -> List[Dict[str, Any]]:\n38\t    \"\"\"Build a single-user-message list for ``call_model(messages=...)`` carrying\n39\t    text plus one or more images, in the FLM-confirmed object form.\"\"\"\n40\t    content: List[Dict[str, Any]] = [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": text}]\n41\t    for img in images:\n42\t        content.append({\"type\": \"image_url\", \"image_url\": {\"url\": to_data_uri(img, mime)}})\n43\t    return [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": content}]"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"94bb5afe-1a7a-417c-846f-f52800afcf30","timestamp":"2026-06-28T21:24:18.120Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\runtime","sessionId":"8a533f